==============================================================================
CLAIM A: gcd(n, 2n-1) = 1 for all n  (=> clock & shell are coprime CRT factors)
==============================================================================
  n in [2,5000): gcd(n,2n-1)!=1 count = 0   (proof: gcd(n,2n-1)=gcd(n,-1)=1)

