==============================================================================
CLAIM C details: n=14 has its ENTIRE prime-power tower on the shell.
==============================================================================
  clock Z/14 = 2*7   H_clk = 1  (squarefree: True)
  shell Z/27 = 3^3   H_shl = 3  (squarefree: False)
  W_14  = 378 = 2*3^3*7
  the ONLY tower prime (exponent>=2) in W_14 is 3, exponent 3 -- ALL from the shell.
  => n=14's famous prime-power obstruction = the 3-adic structure of Z/27
     = the signed-LRC homometry object at C=27 (S708 deficiency 69; S710 3-adic tower).

